# AirTulip — SOW todos (theme / repo scope)

Source: `.cursor/rules/T2_AirTulip_SOW_WithTodos.docx` (12-week sprint, three phases). Use this when prioritizing **Git/theme work** vs handing off to T2 Email, Creative, or Analytics.

## Phase overview

| Phase | Weeks | Focus |
|-------|-------|--------|
| **1 — Clarify & Prove** | 1–4 | Fix funnel, reposition copy, email rebuild, analytics baseline. No new paid traffic until conversion works. |
| **2 — Segment & Optimize** | 5–8 | Persona LPs, affiliates, medical channel, social, retention. |
| **3 — Scale with Confidence** | 9–12 | Paid retargeting, Tier 1 influencers, hospitality/trade, reporting. |

