## Already touched in repo (reference)

- PDP `shark-tank-spotlight` section  
- PDP lateral tabs, Affirm + Truemed in buy box  
- PDP below-fold heading scale (`title-md` + desktop clamp in `theme.css`)  
- `tools/rebuild_product_pdp.py` syncs `product.json` PDP stack  

When implementing SOW items, prefer **RoarTheme patterns**, update `rebuild_product_pdp.py` if it regenerates `product.json`, and avoid reintroducing CLI-invalid `visible_if` on schema settings (see `airtulip-cli-theme-push.mdc`).
